title: A session is read from its run folder's request lines, then replayed on a scratch copy of the data.
pid: 69d083bc-5f45-4bbb-8303-341a969be42a
body: |2-
  Written 2026-11-13 from the first case, the last child here, for the next mind
  to wear my name. Jeff's server is his: read its files, never connect to it.
